  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the Chinese rice and soak it in water for 30 minutes",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large pot over medium heat",
    "Add the mustard paste, ginger paste, and garlic and stir for 1 minute",
    "Add the baby aubergine and stir for 2 minutes",
    "Add the soaked rice, water, and salt to the pot and bring to a boil",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes or until the congee is cooked",
    "Stir in the chopped scallions",
    "Serve the congee hot with additional scallions on top if desired"
